# The history clauses each file of the third major still carries in its comments, one line per file.
#
#   path ~ count
#
# Read by .dev/validate/documentation.sh. The count is a ratchet, not an allowance: a file above its line
# fails, a file below it fails until the line is lowered, and a line for a file that carries none fails until
# it is deleted. The comment reduction of the third major lowers these lines slice by slice; the list is empty
# when it is done.
